		Heading 1:
			Text: Keep with next
		Paragraph: With `Keep with next: true`, a box stays on the same page as the box that follows it. The caption below fits at the end of page 1, but the box it introduces does not, and that box is kept together, so both move to page 2.
			Style: intro
		Block:
			Style: filler
			Box:
				Height: 300
			Text: A filler block, 300 points high, to bring the caption near the end of the page.
		Text: Break: Keep with next: true  (on the caption)
